{
    "chapter_num": 5,
    "verses_count": 21,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Obedience by Faith"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Whoever believes that Jesus is the Christ is born of God, and everyone who loves Him who begot also loves him who is begotten of Him. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "By this we know that we love the children of God, when we love God and keep His commandments. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For this is the love of God, that we keep His commandments. And His commandments are not burdensome. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For whatever is born of God overcomes the world. And this is the victory that has overcome the world—"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "M your"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "our faith. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Who is he who overcomes the world, but he who believes that Jesus is the Son of God?"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Certainty of God’s Witness"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "This is He who came by water and blood—Jesus Christ; not only by water, but by water and blood. And it is the Spirit who bears witness, because the Spirit is truth. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For there are three that bear witness "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU, M omit the words from in heaven (v. 7) through on earth (v. 8). Only 4 or 5 very late mss. contain these words in Greek."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "in heaven: the Father, the Word, and the Holy Spirit; and these three are one. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And there are three that bear witness on earth: the Spirit, the water, and the blood; and these three agree as one."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "If we receive the witness of men, the witness of God is greater; for this is the witness of "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU God, that"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "God which He has testified of His Son. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "He who believes in the Son of God has the witness in himself; he who does not believe God has made Him a liar, because he has not believed the testimony that God has given of His Son. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And this is the testimony: that God has given us eternal life, and this life is in His Son. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "He who has the Son has "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or the life"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "life; he who does not have the Son of God does not have life. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "These things I have written to you who believe in the name of the Son of God, that you may know that you have eternal life, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits the rest of v. 13."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and that you may "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "continue to"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " believe in the name of the Son of God."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Confidence and Compassion in Prayer"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now this is the confidence that we have in Him, that if we ask anything according to His will, He hears us. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And if we know that He hears us, whatever we ask, we know that we have the petitions that we have asked of Him."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "If anyone sees his brother sinning a sin "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "which does"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " not "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "lead"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to death, he will ask, and He will give him life for those who commit sin not "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "leading"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to death. There is sin "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "leading"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to death. I do not say that he should pray about that. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "All unrighteousness is sin, and there is sin not "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "leading"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to death."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Knowing the True—Rejecting the False"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "We know that whoever is born of God does not sin; but he who has been born of God keeps"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "guards"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU him"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "himself, and the wicked one does not touch him."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "We know that we are of God, and the whole world lies "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "under the sway of"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the wicked one."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And we know that the Son of God has come and has given us an understanding, that we may know Him who is true; and we are in Him who is true, in His Son Jesus Christ. This is the true God and eternal life."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Little children, keep yourselves from idols. Amen."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}